---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import iAmReinforce from "../assets/I-am-Reinforce.jpg";
import Github from "./brand/Github.astro";
import X from "./brand/X.astro";
---
<div>
  <figure>
    <Image src={iAmReinforce} alt="site logo card" />
  </figure>
  <div>
    <p>一個喜歡日本動畫和資訊科技的程序員，自稱Reinforce II，平日沒事就玩遊戲，搞伺服器，品嘗美食。有空的話還喜歡寫文章來顯得他很有料(～￣▽￣)～</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/about">關於 Reinforce II</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="social-links">
    <Github href="https://github.com/ReinforceZwei" />
    <X href="https://x.com/ReinforceZw" />
  </div>
</div>

<style>
figure {
  margin: 0;
}
.social-links {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: var(--space-6);
  margin-top: var(--space-4);
}
</style>
